  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration)"
